{"type":"message","id":"f993d4bd","parentId":"99cf6461","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:09:25.646Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_7NsncuU0wl26cAGYfNTr9902","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"        log.warning(f\"⚠️ 下单闸门查持仓异常：{_e}（继续走流程）\")\n\n    size_pct = CONFIG[\"position_size_pct\"]\n    if regime == \"volatile\":\n        size_pct *= 0.6\n\n    # 计算数量并格式化到正确精度\n    raw_qty = (CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * size_pct * 10) / entry_price  # 2026-03-28 老公指示：加 10x 杠杆\n    qty = format_quantity(symbol, raw_qty, entry_price)\n\n    # 实盘交易调用\n    order_result = None\n    if AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED:\n        try:\n            # 调用 binance_auto_trade 模块下单\n            side = \"BUY\" if direction == \"LONG\" else \"SELL\"\n            order_result = place_order(\n                symbol=f\"{symbol}USDT\",\n                side=side,\n                quantity=round(qty, 6),\n                leverage=10,  # 2026-03-27 老公指示：3x→10x 测试两天\n                tp_price=tp_sl.get(\"tp1_price\"),\n                sl_price=tp_sl.get(\"sl_price\"),\n                price=entry_price,\n                reduce_only=False,\n            )\n            log.info(f\"📝 下单结果：{order_result}\")\n        except Exception as e:\n            log.error(f\"❌ 下单失败：{e}\")\n            order_result = {\"error\": str(e)}\n\n[1447 more lines in file. Use offset=1080 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780358965633}}
{"type":"message","id":"0c9e4643","parentId":"f993d4bd","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:09:33.801Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The formula looks correct:\n```python\nraw_qty = (CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * size_pct * 10) / entry_price\n```\n\nWith total_capital=100, size_pct=0.20, leverage multiplier of 10:\n= 100 * 0.20 * 10 / entry_price = 200 / entry_price\n\nFor ETH: 200 / 1998 = 0.1001 → format_quantity → 0.1\nFor XRP: 200 / 1.284 = 155.76 → format_quantity → 155.8\n\nThese are the correct values. But the actual positions were 0.008 and 9.5 respectively.\n\nSo the formula itself is fine. The question is: was the formula actually the one used when these positions were opened?\n\nLet me think about what could produce 0.008 for ETH. If the formula was different:\n- 100 * 0.20 / entry_price = 20 / 1998 = 0.01001 → round to 3 = 0.01\n- But actual is 0.008... still doesn't match.\n\n- What if it was 100 * 0.08 * 10 / entry_price = 80 / 1998 = 0.04003 → 0.04?\n- Still doesn't match 0.008\n\n- What if format_quantity somehow truncates instead of rounds? round(0.01001, 3) = 0.01, not 0.008.\n\nHmm. Let me look at the format_quantity function again:\n```python\ndef format_quantity(symbol, quantity, price):\n    precision = get_quantity_precision(symbol, price)\n    return round(quantity, precision)\n```\n\nFor ETH precision 3: round(0.01001, 3) = 0.010. Not 0.008.\n\nWait, what if the entry_price passed to open_position was vastly different from what I think? Maybe a stale price was used?\n\nWhat if `entry_price` was, say, $25000? Then 200/25000 = 0.008. Hmm that's oddly specific and doesn't match ETH price.\n\nWhat if `total_capital` was actually being read from a different source? Let me check if there's a runtime modification to CONFIG.\n\nActually, let me search for anywhere CONFIG gets modified:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_BXuyFG0crg68q7Ao0WZk3622","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n 'CONFIG\\[.*\\]\\s*=' /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py | head -20","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":453,"output":1109,"cacheRead":47232,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48794,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780358965652}}
