{"type":"message","id":"2010f265","parentId":"93c1b43e","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:10:57.914Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full picture! Let me trace through:\n\n1. Line 3499-3500: ETH 开空 qty=0.098 @ $0.00 AND XRP 开多 qty=10.8 @ $0.00 — these were opened with price $0.00! That's a major issue.\n\n2. Then lines 3513, 3519: Correctly opened ETH 0.1 and XRP 149.3 — these overwrote the wrong positions.\n\n3. Lines 35599, 35904: Correct positions closed.\n\n4. Line 35652 (Jun 1, 22:00): ETH SHORT rebuild: API原始=0.092 → 风控标准=0.102\n   - The SHORT position of 0.092 ETH appeared somehow\n   \n5. Line 35706: ETH SHORT entry=1961.0 amount=0.092 — confirmed\n\n6. Line 35947-35948 (Jun 1, 22:20): XRP 9.5 appeared too\n   ```\n   🔧 反转重建 XRP：API原始=9.5000 → 风控标准=155.8000\n   ```\n\n7. Line 45459 (Jun 2, 07:47): ETH: API原始=0.0080 → 风控标准=0.1000\n   - ETH was further reduced from 0.092 to 0.008!\n\nSo the 0.092 ETH SHORT and 9.5 XRP LONG positions appeared on the exchange between 22:00 and 22:20 on June 1, via some mechanism that's NOT the normal `open_position` function (since there are no corresponding \"下单详情\" log entries).\n\nLet me look at lines around 35600-35700 and 35900-36000 to see what happened.\n\nActually, wait — line 3499-3500 shows:\n```\n2026-06-01 20:49:20 - ETHUSDT 开空 数量=0.098000 @ $0.000000\n2026-06-01 20:49:21 - XRPUSDT 开多 数量=10.800000 @ $0.000000\n```\n\nThese were opened with price $0! And they were opened BEFORE the correct positions (lines 3513, 3519). The correct positions were opened at 20:50. So both a wrong and a correct set were opened.\n\nBut then at 21:50 and 22:16, the correct positions were closed. But the wrong positions (0.098 ETH and 10.8 XRP... or some variant) remained on the exchange!\n\nWait, that can't be right either. Opening ETH SHORT then ETH LONG would just result in a net position. But if they were opened within seconds... \n\nActually, wait. The monitor runs multiple threads or async operations? Let me look at the timing:\n\nLine 3499: ETH 开空 qty=0.098 @ $0.00 — Jun 1, 20:49\nLine 3500: XRP 开多 qty=10.8 @ $0.00 — Jun 1, 20:49  \nLine 3513: ETH 开多 qty=0.1 @ $2003.99 — Jun 1, 20:50\nLine 3519: XRP 开空 qty=149.3 @ $1.3395 — Jun 1, 20:50\n\nIf the first set were SELL and the second set were BUY (or vice versa), they'd cancel out. But:\n- Set 1: ETH SHORT, XRP LONG\n- Set 2: ETH LONG, XRP SHORT\n\nSo they should have canceled each other out! But somehow 0.092 ETH SHORT and 9.5 XRP LONG remained.\n\nThe net would be:\n- ETH: -0.098 + 0.1 = 0.002 LONG → but we see 0.092 SHORT... doesn't match\n- XRP: 10.8 - 149.3 = -138.5 SHORT → but we see 9.5 LONG... doesn't match\n\nHmm, that doesn't work. Maybe the orders at lines 3499-3500 FAILED (price $0 is suspicious), and then different orders created the positions.\n\nLet me look more carefully at the section around lines 3490-3525.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_x1hXROzche1KohoNEpjG9899","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"sed -n '3490,3530p' /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":827,"output":1992,"cacheRead":56448,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59267,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780359044592}}
