{"type":"message","id":"4683a89e","parentId":"8c71eb29","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:12:11.057Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"NOW I see something extremely suspicious!\n\nAt 12:42:32, the log shows:\n```\n📊 开仓前检查：API 持仓=4, 本地缓存=4, 采用=4/4\n⚠️ BTC 已达最大持仓数，跳过开仓\n```\n\nThen at 12:43:20:\n```\n📊 开仓前检查：API 持仓=4, 本地缓存=4, 采用=4/4\n⚠️ BTC 已达最大持仓数，跳过开仓\n```\n\nThen IMMEDIATELY after: 4 orders placed with price $0:\n```\n📝 下单详情：DOTUSDT 开多 数量=152.800000 @ $0.000000\n📝 下单详情：ETHUSDT 开空 数量=0.098000 @ $0.000000\n📝 下单详情：XRPUSDT 开多 数量=10.800000 @ $0.000000\n📝 下单详情：BTCUSDT 开多 数量=0.003000 @ $0.000000\n```\n\nThen at 12:44:27:\n```\nAPI 持仓=0  ← all 4 positions GONE from the exchange!\n```\n\nSo the 4 orders with price $0 FAILED (hence API shows 0 positions), but then the code started opening correct positions:\n```\n📝 下单详情：DOTUSDT 开空 数量=168.100000 @ $1.190000 ← correct!\n```\n\nOK so these price=$0 orders came from a different code path. They were placed despite the \"跳过开仓\" message. \n\nLet me look at whether there's a \"restore from cache\" code path that runs after the initial API sync but before the main loop.\n\nActually, wait — let me look at what happens right after the startup sequence, where `submit_initial_algo_orders` is called. That function might be calling `open_position`.\n\nLet me look at `submit_initial_algo_orders`:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_RCIyHuUGHne0yuiT9lhW8287","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","offset":740,"limit":40}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":988,"output":953,"cacheRead":66944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68885,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780359123559}}
{"type":"message","id":"ff00421d","parentId":"4683a89e","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:12:11.105Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_RCIyHuUGHne0yuiT9lhW8287","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\ndef submit_initial_algo_orders(pos: dict):\n    \"\"\"\n    为从 API 同步/方向反转后的持仓提交初始止盈止损 Algo 单。\n    取消该币种所有旧 Algo 单，然后提交新的 STOP_MARKET 和 TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET。\n    \"\"\"\n    if not AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED:\n        return\n    try:\n        sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n        typ = pos[\"type\"]\n        sl_price = pos.get(\"sl_price\")\n        tp_price = pos.get(\"tp1_price\")\n        if not sl_price or not tp_price:\n            return\n\n        sym_usdt = f\"{sym}USDT\"\n        # 先取消该币种所有旧 Algo 单（止损/止盈都清）\n        cancel_algo_orders(sym_usdt)\n\n        # 提交止损\n        sl_side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n        sl_result = place_algo_conditional_order(sym_usdt, sl_side, \"STOP_MARKET\", sl_price)\n        if isinstance(sl_result, dict) and sl_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(f\"📌 {sym} 止损 Algo 单已提交：{sl_price} algoId={sl_result.get('algoId')}\")\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {sym} 止损 Algo 单提交失败：{sl_result}\")\n\n        # 提交止盈\n        tp_side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n        tp_result = place_algo_conditional_order(sym_usdt, tp_side, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\", tp_price)\n        if isinstance(tp_result, dict) and tp_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(f\"📌 {sym} 止盈 Algo 单已提交：{tp_price} algoId={tp_result.get('algoId')}\")\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {sym} 止盈 Algo 单提交失败：{tp_result}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        log.warning(f\"⚠️ {sym} 提交初始 Algo 单异常：{e}\")\n\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n# 八、熔断器\n\n[1747 more lines in file. Use offset=780 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780359131094}}
{"type":"message","id":"bd52cc64","parentId":"ff00421d","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:12:18.223Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`submit_initial_algo_orders` only submits algo orders (stop-loss, take-profit), NOT market orders. So that's not the source of the price=$0 orders.\n\nLet me search for another code path. Maybe there's a position recovery or sync function that actually places market orders.\n\nWait, let me go back to the startup code and look more carefully. The 4 orders with price=$0 were placed between 12:43:20 and 12:44:27. At 12:43:20, the main loop was running (showing \"开仓前检查\") and said \"跳过开仓\". Then the 4 orders appeared.\n\nLet me search for what code could place these orders. \n\nActually, wait — maybe these aren't market orders at all. Maybe they're something else. Let me look at the log_order_info function:\n\n```python\ndef log_order_info(symbol, side, quantity, price, tp_price, sl_price, reduce_only=False):\n    ...\n    action = \"开多\" if side == \"BUY\" else \"开空\"\n    log_msg = f\"📝 下单详情：{symbol} {action} 数量={quantity:.6f} @ ${price:.6f}\"\n```\n\nAnd `place_order` calls this with `price=entry_price`. When `entry_price` is 0, the log shows `@ $0.000000`.\n\nSo these ARE market orders placed via `place_order()` with price=0. But not via `open_position()` — because those would show the TP/SL prices too, like:\n```\n📝 下单详情：ETHUSDT 开多 数量=0.100000 @ $2003.990000, 止盈=$2084.150000, 止损=$1963.910000\n```\n\nThe ones without TP/SL were placed through a code path that calls `place_order()` directly, not `open_position()`.\n\nLet me search for all direct calls to `place_order()` in the monitor:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_Bt1opFte27eC5tHX7ESs1385","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n 'place_order(' /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"i