{"type":"message","id":"4f473ff9","parentId":"57881d37","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:12:32.221Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Only two calls to `place_order` in the monitor:\n- Line 1066: in `open_position()` — includes TP/SL prices\n- Line 1176: in close position logic — uses `reduce_only=True`\n\nSo the price=$0 orders MUST have come from `open_position()` at line 1066.\n\nBut `open_position()` shows TP/SL prices in the log... wait, let me look again:\n```\n📝 下单详情：DOTUSDT 开多 数量=152.800000 @ $0.000000\n📝 下单详情：ETHUSDT 开空 数量=0.098000 @ $0.000000\n```\n\nNo TP/SL shown. But `open_position()` calls:\n```python\norder_result = place_order(\n    symbol=f\"{symbol}USDT\",\n    side=side,\n    quantity=round(qty, 6),\n    leverage=10,\n    tp_price=tp_sl.get(\"tp1_price\"),\n    sl_price=tp_sl.get(\"sl_price\"),\n    price=entry_price,\n    reduce_only=False,\n)\n```\n\nAnd `place_order` calls `log_order_info`:\n```python\ndef log_order_info(symbol, side, quantity, price, tp_price, sl_price, reduce_only=False):\n    ...\n    log_msg = f\"📝 下单详情：{symbol} {action} 数量={quantity:.6f} @ ${price:.6f}\"\n    if tp_price and sl_price:\n        log_msg += f\", 止盈=${tp_price:.6f}, 止损=${sl_price:.6f}\"\n```\n\nSo when `tp_price` and `sl_price` are both falsy (None or 0), the TP/SL info is not added to the log.\n\n`tp_sl.get(\"tp1_price\")` could be None if tp_sl doesn't have the key. And `calc_tp_sl(entry=0, ...)` would calculate TP/SL based on price 0, giving tp1=0 and sl=0. Then `place_order` receives `tp_price=0` and `sl_price=0`. In `log_order_info`, `if tp_price and sl_price:` → `if 0 and 0:` → False. So no TP/SL in log.\n\nThis confirms: the positions were opened through `open_position()` with `entry_price=0`.\n\nNow, `entry_price=0` means the price stream wasn't ready. The code at line 2467 does:\n```python\nentry = pd[\"price\"]\n```\n\nIf `pd[\"price\"]` is 0, the price stream returned 0.\n\nBut wait, the price stream should have been ready by that point — the startup code waits up to 30 seconds for it. Let me check if there's a fallback where the main loop runs even without price data.\n\nActually, looking at the startup code (line 2075-2086):\n```python\nasyncio.create_task(price_stream.start())\n\n# 等待WebSocket就绪\nlog.info(\"等待WebSocket价格流就绪...\")\nfor _ in range(30):\n    if price_stream.is_ready():\n        break\n    await asyncio.sleep(1)\nlog.info(f\"价格流就绪: {list(price_stream.prices.keys())}\")\n\n# 加载持仓（从 Binance API 同步真实持仓）\n```\n\nOn May 30, the WebSocket might have failed silently, and the prices were all 0. But then how did the correct orders at 12:44 have correct prices?\n\nActually wait, the orders with price $0 were placed at ~12:43, and the correct orders at ~12:44-12:45. During startup, the price stream was established. But between the initial sync and the main loop, the prices might have been 0.\n\nActually, I think I know what happened!\n\nLook at the startup sequence:\n1. Price stream starts\n2. Wait for prices (up to 30 seconds)  \n3. Load positions from API\n4. `submit_initial_algo_orders` for each position\n\nThen the main loop starts:\n5. Fetch prices from WebSocket — if WebSocket drops, prices might be 0\n6. Score calculation — if price is 0, scores might be wrong\n7. Open positions with price 0\n\nBut the real question is: why did the log show \"跳过开仓\" (skip opening) at 12:43:20, and then STILL open positions?\n\nThe \"跳过开仓\" log says BTC reached max positions. But then ALL 4 symbols got orders. This means there's ANOTHER code path that opens positions after \"跳过开仓\".\n\nOH WAIT. I think I found it! Let me look at the \"修复重建\" (position repair) code. Let me check if the repair code opens positions directly.\n\nActually, let me look at the \"反转重建\" code more carefully — the one at line 2235:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_3Sheib8vieN4VlldbbtM1115","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":70,"offset":2185}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":156,"output":2186,"cacheRead":69376,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":71718,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780359138412}}
{"type":"message","id":"e4e0a66b","parentId":"4f473ff9","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:12:32.308Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_3Sheib8vieN4VlldbbtM1115","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"        except Exception as e:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ 爆仓保护检查失败：{e}\")\n\n        # 每 20 个 tick（5 分钟）从 API 同步持仓\n        # 🐛 Bug 修复：API 是真相，本地是缓存。API 返回 0 说明真的没有持仓\n        if scheduler.tick % 20 == 0:\n            try:\n                api_positions = get_all_positions()\n                # 🐛 Bug 修复：API 返回 dict 表示错误，保留缓存不处理\n                if isinstance(api_positions, dict) and 'error' in api_positions:\n                    log.warning(f\"⚠️ API 查询失败，保留本地缓存：{api_positions['error'][:50]}\")\n                    api_count = -1  # 标记失败\n                else:\n                    api_count = sum(1 for p in api_positions if float(p.get('amount', 0)) != 0)\n                \n                # 判断是否需要重建持仓：计数变化 OR 方向变化\n                need_rebuild = False\n                \n                if api_count == 0:\n                    if len(positions) > 0:\n                        log.info(f\"🔄 持仓同步：API 持仓=0，清空本地缓存（原{len(positions)}个）\")\n                        positions = []\n                        save_positions(positions)\n                        log.info(\"✅ 持仓同步完成：0 个（API 为空）\")\n                elif api_count > 0 and api_count != len(positions):\n                    need_rebuild = True\n                    log.info(f\"🔄 持仓同步：本地{len(positions)}个 → API{api_count}个\")\n                elif api_count > 0 and api_count == len(positions) and api_count > 0:\n                    # 🐛 仓位反转检测：计数相同但方向不同时也要重建\n                    for p in api_positions:\n                        amt = float(p.get('amount', 0))\n                        if amt != 0:\n                            sym = p['symbol']\n                            api_dir = 'SHORT' if amt < 0 else 'LONG'\n                            for lp in positions:\n                                if lp['symbol'] == sym and lp['type'] != api_dir:\n                                    need_rebuild = True\n                                    log.info(f\"🔄 持仓同步：{sym} 方向变化 {lp['type']}→{api_dir}，强制重建\")\n                                    break\n                            if need_rebuild:\n                                break\n                \n                if need_rebuild:\n                    new_positions = []\n                    for p in api_positions:\n                        amt = float(p.get('amount', 0))\n                        if amt != 0:\n                            symbol = p['symbol']\n                            entry = float(p.get('entry_price', 0))\n                            # 🐛 修复：反转重建持仓时按风控规则重算数量，不用 API 的 abs(amt)\n                            size_pct = CONFIG[\"position_size_pct\"]\n                            expected_qty = (CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * size_pct * 10) / entry\n                            correct_amount = format_quantity(symbol, expected_qty, entry)\n                            log.info(f\"🔧 反转重建 {symbol}：API原始={abs(amt):.4f} → 风控标准={correct_amount:.4f}\")\n                            # 重建止盈止损字段（防止 KeyError）\n                            atr = abs(entry * 0.02)  # 估算 ATR\n                            tp1 = round(entry * (1 - 0.04) if amt < 0 else entry * (1 + 0.04), 4)\n                            sl = round(entry * (1 + 0.02) if amt < 0 else entry * (1 - 0.02), 4)\n                            new_positions.append({\n                                'symbol': symbol,\n                                'type': 'SHORT' if amt < 0 else 'LONG',\n                                'entry_price': entry,\n                                'amount': correct_amount,\n                                'tp1_price': tp1,\n                                'tp2_price': 0.0,  # 已废弃，全在 TP1 全平\n                                'sl_price': sl,\n                                'tp1_hit': False,\n                                'size_remaining': 1.0,\n                            })\n                    positions = new_positions\n\n[272 more lines in file. Use offset=2255 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780359152286}}
