{"type":"message","id":"99a44239","parentId":"2e677ecf","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:13:37.825Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"仓位修好了 ✅ 总结一下：\n\n**修复的 bug（2个）：**\n\n1. **`binance_auto_trade.py`** — `place_order()` 收了 `reduce_only` 参数但从没传给币安 API，导致小仓位平不掉（ETH 0.008 就是卡在这）\n\n2. **`crypto_signal_monitor.py`** — `open_position()` 没有价格校验，price=0 时会算出 infinity 的仓位量，直接下出垃圾单\n\n**根因：** 5月30日币安侧凭空出现了一批畸形仓位（不是你也不是 monitor 开的），monitor 的\"反转重建\"代码读到后重建了本地缓存，之后仓位越缩越小，修也修不掉因为 bug 1 卡住了。\n\n需要 `kj` 重启 monitor 让补丁生效，现在重启吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":360,"output":184,"cacheRead":80000,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80544,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780359212564}}
