怎么是负的\" — they saw +8 USDT from BTC, but now the report shows negative realized PnL.\n\nLooking at positions output: \"今日已实现: -1.82 USDT\"\n\nThis might be because:\n1. ETH got stopped out at 1961 (loss)\n2. XRP bounced around creating realized losses\n3. BTC profit of ~$7.25 should offset, but maybe the PnL calculation is off\n\nLet me calculate approximate realized PnL:\n- BTC SHORT close: (73252-70834)*0.003 = +7.254\n- ETH SELL 0.092 @ 1973.34: was this closing part of the 0.192 ETH position? If entry was ~2004, loss = (1973-2004)*0.092 = -2.85\n- ETH SELL 0.100 @ 1961: If entry was 2004, loss = (1961-2004)*0.1 = -4.3\n- Initial XRP close: (1.2944-1.295)*9.5 = -0.006 (roughly flat)\n- Later XRP: need to trace...\n\nActually, this is getting complicated. Let me just present the current state clearly and the recent trade activity to the user.\n\nThe key message: BTC did make ~$7, but ETH got stopped out at a loss which ate most of it. Let me check the monitor log for the recent activity.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"BTC 刚才确实到了止盈位平仓了（+$7.25），但 ETH 碰到了止损。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_8QpD4LYF38Jx0jCm4qZQ9665","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"tail -60 /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | grep -E '平仓|止盈|止损|TP1|SL|PnL|开多|开空|关闭|反转'","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":498,"output":3533,"cacheRead":89216,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":93247,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780369360108}}
