{"type":"message","id":"c8dcd004","parentId":"dd6972c2","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:03:44.453Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Only BTC close today. The ETH and XRP close events I saw earlier in the recent trades were from MY manual operations or the monitor's automatic operations. Let me check the complete trade picture.\n\nFrom the recent filled orders:\n1. BTC BUY 0.003 @ 70834.20 — BTC SHORT closed (TP1 hit) → +$8.83\n2. ETH trades:\n   - SELL 0.092 @ 1973.34 — partial close from 0.192 ETH (started 0.1 + 0.092)\n   - SELL 0.100 @ 1961.00 — close remaining\n   - BUY 0.100 @ 1998.41 — new LONG\n   - BUY 0.092 @ 2004.69 — add\n   - SELL 0.092 @ 1972.19 — close add (loss)\n\n3. XRP trades:\n   - SELL 9.5 @ 1.2944 — close old LONG\n   - BUY 155.8 @ 1.2949 — new XRP LONG\n   - SELL 295.6 @ 1.277 — XRP SHORT open\n  \nWait, \"SELL 295.6\" — if we consider market convention, a SELL opens a SHORT or closes a LONG. At this point XRP had 155.8 LONG + some leftover. SELL 295.6 would close 155.8 LONG and open 139.8 SHORT.\n\nLet me just present the clear picture: BTC TP1 hit, made +$8.83. But the displayed \"今日已实现 -1.82\" seems wrong. The API `fetch_today_realized_pnl()` returned None, so the monitor might be calculating realized PnL from its own tracking, which could be inaccurate.\n\nActually, the user's concern is valid. The BTC made +$8.83 alone. Even if ETH and XRP lost some, the total should be positive. Let me check why the realized PnL shows -1.82.\n\nMaybe it's a stale calculation from earlier before BTC was closed? Let me re-run the query.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"逻辑清楚了，来看："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_JFIln0KT4cEr3vJBau8H8586","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport sys, json\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\n# Get today's trades from API\nresult = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/userTrades', {'limit': 50})\nif isinstance(result, list):\n    today_trades = []\n    for t in result:\n        # Filter today's trades\n        import time\n        t_time = t.get('time', 0)\n        if t_time > 0 and time.time() - t_time/1000 < 86400:\n            today_trades.append(t)\n    \n    total_pnl = 0\n    for t in today_trades:\n        pnl = float(t.get('realizedPnl', 0))\n        total_pnl += pnl\n        print(f\\\"{t['symbol']} {t['side']} qty={t['qty']} price={t['price']} pnl={pnl}\\\")\n    \n    print(f'\\nTotal realized: {total_pnl} USDT')\n    print(f'Commission: {sum(float(t.get(\\\"commission\\\", 0)) for t in today_trades)}')\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v InsecureRequestWarning | grep -v 'warnings\\.' | grep -v 'INFO.*加载'","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":506,"output":1277,"cacheRead":94208,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95991,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780369409051}}
