{"type":"message","id":"c7a21b4b","parentId":"e1d92063","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:06:01.447Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_pDZ1lv328BqzFuYBAJcE7789","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\ndef main():\n    args = sys.argv[1:]\n    push_card_mode = \"--push\" in args\n\n    state = load_json(STATE_FILE, {})\n    daily_pnl = state.get(\"daily_pnl\", 0.0)\n    positions_local = load_json(POSITIONS_FILE, [])\n\n    positions = fetch_real_positions()\n    stale_mode = False\n    if not positions and positions_local:\n        # Binance API 短时抖动时，用本地账本兜底，避免“查不到持仓详情”\n        stale_mode = True\n        positions = positions_local\n\n    if not positions:\n        msg = \"📭 当前无持仓（已查询 Binance Testnet API）\"\n        if push_card_mode:\n            from feishu_helper import push_card, md, note\n            push_card(\n                \"👑 当前持仓\",\n                [\n                    md(f\"### 📭 暂无持仓\\n\\n_系统正在持续监控信号，符合条件会自动开仓_\"),\n                    md(\n                        f\"<font color='grey'>**今日已实现：**</font> \"\n                        f\"{('🟢' if daily_pnl >= 0 else '🔴')} `{daily_pnl:+.2f}` USDT\"\n                    ),\n                    note(\n                        f\"📡 Binance Testnet · {datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')}\"\n\n[124 more lines in file. Use offset=100 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780369561434}}
{"type":"message","id":"4fe08d26","parentId":"c7a21b4b","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:06:07.170Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so `query_positions.py` reads `daily_pnl` from `crypto_state.json`. This state file is maintained by the monitor's `restore_daily_pnl` and periodic updates. The issue is that this state can get out of sync with the actual Binance API.\n\nThe fix: instead of reading from the state file, I should fetch the actual realized PnL from the Binance API directly. The `fetch_today_realized_pnl` function in `binance_auto_trade.py` already does this.\n\nLet me update `query_positions.py` to use the API data:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ADgbbPJr38wKiqPb8MsX6639","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/query_positions.py","limit":30,"offset":1}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":358,"output":345,"cacheRead":97152,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97855,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780369561460}}
{"type":"message","id":"8cf918fa","parentId":"4fe08d26","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:06:07.268Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_ADgbbPJr38wKiqPb8MsX6639","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nquery_positions.py - 查询当前实时持仓 + 浮动盈亏\n\n数据源（按优先级）：\n    1. binance_auto_trade.get_all_positions()  (复用主交易模块的 API 调用，签名 100% 一致)\n    2. crypto_state.json                       (今日已实现盈亏)\n    3. crypto_positions.json                   (本地账本，仅用于附加 SL/TP 信息)\n\n用法：\n    python3 query_positions.py            # stdout\n    python3 query_positions.py --push     # 推送卡片到飞书群\n\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nSCRIPT_DIR = Path(__file__).parent\nPOSITIONS_FILE = SCRIPT_DIR / \"crypto_positions.json\"\nSTATE_FILE = SCRIPT_DIR / \"crypto_state.json\"\n\nsys.path.insert(0, str(SCRIPT_DIR))\n\nEMOJI = {\n    \"BTC\": \"👑\", \"ETH\": \"💎\", \"SOL\": \"⚡\",\n    \"BNB\": \"🔶\", \"DOT\": \"🌐\", \"LINK\": \"🔗\", \"XRP\": \"🪙\",\n}\n\n\n\n[193 more lines in file. Use offset=31 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780369567243}}
{"type":"message","id":"5a2081f3","parentId":"8cf918fa","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:06:11.419Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to:\n1. Add an import for `fetch_today_realized_pnl` from `binance_auto_trade`\n2. Replace the state file read with a call to `fetch_today_realized_pnl`\n3. Fall back to the state file if the API call fails\n\nLet me also check the `fetch_today_realized_pnl` function signature.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_CDvnHBE26gMGJFHNvP8X4567","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py","limit":40,"offset":158}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":348,"output":251,"cacheRead":97664,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98263,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780369567283}}
{"type":"message","id":"b7613494","parentId":"5a2081f3","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:06:11.536Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_CDvnHBE26gMGJFHNvP8X4567","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def fetch_today_realized_pnl(symbols: list[str] | None = None) -> float | None:\n    \"\"\"\n    从 userTrades 汇总今日（Asia/Shanghai 自然日）已实现盈亏。\n    重启后用于校准 daily_pnl，避免漏计 kj 宕机期间的平仓。\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        from zoneinfo import ZoneInfo\n\n        now = datetime.now(ZoneInfo(\"Asia/Shanghai\"))\n        start = now.replace(hour=0, minute=0, second=0, microsecond=0)\n        since_ms = int(start.timestamp() * 1000)\n    except Exception:\n        today = datetime.now().date()\n        start = datetime.combine(today, datetime.min.time())\n        since_ms = int(start.timestamp() * 1000)\n\n    total = 0.0\n    syms = symbols or []\n    any_ok = False\n    for sym in syms:\n        result = request(\n            \"GET\",\n            \"/fapi/v1/userTrades\",\n            {\"symbol\": f\"{sym}USDT\", \"startTime\": since_ms, \"limit\": 1000},\n        )\n        if isinstance(result, dict) and result.get(\"error\"):\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ userTrades 失败 {sym}: {result.get('error')}\")\n            continue\n        if not isinstance(result, list):\n            continue\n        any_ok = True\n        for t in result:\n            if isinstance(t, dict):\n                total += float(t.get(\"realizedPnl\", 0) or 0)\n    return round(total, 4) if any_ok else None\n\n\ndef get_account_balance():\n    \"\"\"获取账户余额\"\"\"\n    result = request(\"GET\", \"/fapi/v2/balance\")\n\n[386 more lines in file. Use offset=198 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780369571518}}
{"type":"message","id":"d3011e85","parentId":"b7613494","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:06:16.481Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`fetch_today_realized_pnl(symbols)` needs a list of symbols. Let me check what symbols are configured in the monitor. I'll use the same symbol list as the monitor.\n\nI also notice the function requires `symbols` to be passed - if empty, it returns None. So I need to pass the symbols we want to check.\n\nLet me modify `query_positions.py` to:\n1. Try to call `fetch_today_realized_pnl` with the configured symbols\n2. If that returns a valid number, use it\n3. If it fails or returns None, fall back to the state file","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_DC9vghT35vCXfjzubuG46688","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/query_positions.py","limit":55,"offset":38}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":412,"output":351,"cacheRead":98176,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98939,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780369571556}}
{"type":"message","id":"b07a8bed","parentId":"d3011e85","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:06:16.556Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_DC9vghT35vCXfjzubuG46688","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\ndef fetch_real_positions() -> list[dict]:\n    \"\"\"复用 binance_auto_trade.get_all_positions() —— 签名/配置/代理与主交易模块完全一致\"\"\"\n    try:\n        import binance_auto_trade as bat\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"[ERROR] 无法导入 binance_auto_trade: {e}\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return []\n    try:\n        return bat.get_all_positions() or []\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"[ERROR] 调用 get_all_positions 失败: {e}\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return []\n\n\ndef calc_pnl_pct(pos: dict) -> float:\n    entry = pos.get(\"entry_price\", 0)\n    current = pos.get(\"current_price\", 0) or pos.get(\"mark_price\", 0)\n    if entry <= 0 or current <= 0:\n        return 0.0\n    if pos.get(\"type\") == \"LONG\":\n        return (current - entry) / entry * 100\n    return (entry - current) / entry * 100\n\n\ndef find_local_meta(positions_local: list, symbol: str) -> dict:\n    for p in positions_local:\n        if p.get(\"symbol\") == symbol:\n            return p\n    return {}\n\n\ndef main():\n    args = sys.argv[1:]\n    push_card_mode = \"--push\" in args\n\n    state = load_json(STATE_FILE, {})\n    daily_pnl = state.get(\"daily_pnl\", 0.0)\n    positions_local = load_json(POSITIONS_FILE, [])\n\n    positions = fetch_real_positions()\n    stale_mode = False\n    if not positions and positions_local:\n        # Binance API 短时抖动时，用本地账本兜底，避免“查不到持仓详情”\n        stale_mode = True\n        positions = positions_local\n\n    if not positions:\n        msg = \"📭 当前无持仓（已查询 Binance Testnet API）\"\n        if push_card_mode:\n            from feishu_helper import push_card, md, note\n            push_card(\n                \"👑 当前持仓\",\n                [\n\n[131 more lines in file. Use offset=93 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780369576548}}
