{"type":"message","id":"24bccc8a","parentId":"d7a59e5e","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:07:56.533Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! The income endpoint returns -1.82 — the same as what `query_positions.py` was showing! But my manual calculation from userTrades showed +6.75.\n\nWait, let me reconsider. The `income` endpoint aggregates REALIZED_PNL events. But the userTrades API shows realized PnL per trade. These should match, but they don't.\n\nLet me check: maybe the income endpoint only includes some types of realized PnL? Or maybe my userTrades calculation was wrong (I might have included trades from before today).\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The userTrades showed 16 trades with total PnL of +6.75. But maybe some of those were from yesterday (before midnight Asia/Shanghai).\n\nLet me re-check by filtering userTrades properly by time:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_tva9XbOI1VOnAyE0PCgg9087","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport sys, time\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom zoneinfo import ZoneInfo\n\n# Today's start in ms (Asia/Shanghai)\nnow = datetime.now(ZoneInfo('Asia/Shanghai'))\nstart = now.replace(hour=0, minute=0, second=0, microsecond=0)\nsince_ms = int(start.timestamp() * 1000)\nprint(f'Today start: {start} (ms={since_ms})')\n\n# Get trades for all symbols that had trades\nsyms = ['DOTUSDT', 'ETHUSDT', 'XRPUSDT', 'BTCUSDT']\ntotal = 0.0\nall_trades = []\nfor s in syms:\n    result = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/userTrades', {\n        'symbol': s, 'startTime': since_ms, 'limit': 1000\n    })\n    if isinstance(result, list):\n        for t in result:\n            t_time = t.get('time', 0)\n            pnl = float(t.get('realizedPnl', 0))\n            total += pnl\n            all_trades.append((t_time, s, t['side'], t['qty'], t['price'], pnl))\n\nall_trades.sort()\nfor t in all_trades:\n    ts = datetime.fromtimestamp(t[0]/1000, ZoneInfo('Asia/Shanghai')).strftime('%H:%M:%S')\n    print(f'{ts} {t[1]} {t[2]} qty={t[3]} price={t[4]} pnl={t[5]:.4f}')\nprint(f'\\nTotal realized PnL: {total:.4f}')\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v InsecureRequestWarning | grep -v 'warnings\\.' | grep -v 'INFO.*加载'","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":108,"output":823,"cacheRead":101504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102435,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780369662614}}
