{"type":"message","id":"897d5395","parentId":"b32f0ae2","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:08:35.645Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the full picture. When filtering by today's date (Asia/Shanghai, June 2 starting at midnight):\n\nTrades:\n1. 03:29 ETH BUY 0.1 @ 1998.41 → PnL: -3.4417 (this was a STOP OUT from an older SHORT position?!)\n   Wait, this is a BUY with negative PnL. A BUY closes a SHORT or opens a LONG. Negative PnL on a BUY means it closed a SHORT at a loss. So there was an ETH SHORT that got stopped at a loss of -3.44.\n   \n2. 08:07 XRP SELL 9.5 @ 1.2944 → PnL: +0.1007\n3. 08:08 ETH partial fills → PnL: 0.0\n4. 08:09 XRP BUY 155.8 → PnL: 0.0 (new LONG)\n5. 10:07 ETH SELL 0.092 @ 1972.19 → PnL: -2.9437\n6. 10:07 XRP SELL 295.6 @ 1.277 → PnL: -2.7888\n7. 10:14 BTC BUY 0.003 @ 70834.20 → PnL: +7.2534\n\nTotal: -3.4417 + 0.1007 + 0 + 0 + 0 + 0 - 2.9437 - 2.7888 + 7.2534 = -1.8201\n\nWait, that's -1.82. But earlier I calculated +6.75 when I included trades that must have been from BEFORE today.\n\nSo the user's question \"刚刚不是还盈利8ubtc吗，现在怎么是负的\" is about the hourly report. The hourly report uses the crypto_state.json, which might be stale or using a different calculation method.\n\nLet me re-examine:\n- userTrades for today: -1.82 USDT (confirmed by both income endpoint and userTrades)\n- The -1.82 includes a -3.44 ETH loss from yesterday's position that was closed early today\n\nSo the -1.82 is CORRECT according to Binance's API. The daily PnL as of now (11:18) is -1.82 USDT.\n\nBut the user saw +8 earlier (BTC TP1 at 10:14). The problem is that earlier in the day (around 03:29), an ETH SHORT position was closed at a loss of -3.44, and then at 10:07, ETH and XRP were closed at losses. So the total for the day is:\n+7.25 (BTC) - 3.44 (ETH early) - 2.94 (ETH) - 2.79 (XRP) + 0.1 (XRP) = -1.82\n\nSo the daily PnL IS actually -1.82. The query_positions.py was showing the correct value! \n\nWait, but earlier I calculated +6.75 from the same trades — I must have included trades from May 31 or earlier in that calculation because my time filter was `time.time() - t_time/1000 < 86400` (last 24 hours from now), not today's date.\n\nOK so the issue is NOT that query_positions.py is wrong. The query_positions.py was right. The daily PnL IS -1.82 because:\n\n1. BTC TP1 profit +7.25 was offset by ETH losses earlier in the day:\n   - Early morning ETH close: -3.44\n   - Later ETH/XRP closes: -5.73\n   - Net: +7.25 - 9.17 + 0.1 = -1.82\n\nSo the \"今日已实现\" showing -1.82 is CORRECT. My earlier analysis was wrong because I included trades from previous days.\n\nI should revert my change to query_positions.py because the original code was correct — the state file was being kept in sync correctly. The user's confusion was about the hourly report, not about query_positions.py.\n\nLet me revert the change.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"等一下 — 重新核实后发现 `query_positions.py` 的 -1.82 其实是正确的。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_hZXAo5Jqu7THZgnToKAI1994","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom zoneinfo import ZoneInfo\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\n# Today's trades only\nnow = datetime.now(ZoneInfo('Asia/Shanghai'))\nstart = now.replace(hour=0, minute=0, second=0, microsecond=0)\nsince_ms = int(start.timestamp() * 1000)\n\nsyms = ['DOTUSDT', 'ETHUSDT', 'XRPUSDT', 'BTCUSDT']\ntotal = 0.0\nfor s in syms:\n    result = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/userTrades', {'symbol': s, 'startTime': since_ms, 'limit': 1000})\n    if isinstance(result, list):\n        for t in result:\n            ts = datetime.fromtimestamp(t['time']/1000, ZoneInfo('Asia/Shanghai')).strftime('%H:%M')\n            pnl = float(t.get('realizedPnl', 0))\n            total += pnl\n            if pnl != 0:\n                print(f'{ts} {t[\\\"symbol\\\"]} {t[\\\"side\\\"]} PnL: {pnl:+.4f}')\n\nprint(f'\\n今日合计: {total:+.2f} USDT')\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v InsecureRequestWarning | grep -v 'warnings\\.' | grep -v 'INFO.*加载'","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":378,"output":2235,"cacheRead":102400,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":105013,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780369690835}}
