{"type":"message","id":"c9d63a63","parentId":"ff31fa44","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:15:41.765Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if everything is fixed. Let me summarize what was done:\n\n1. ETH and XRP positions were corrected (amounts fixed)\n2. Stop-loss and take-profit orders were manually set for all positions\n3. Two code bugs were fixed:\n   - `binance_auto_trade.py`: `reduceOnly` parameter wasn't being passed to Binance API\n   - `crypto_signal_monitor.py`: Added price validation guard in `open_position` to prevent orders with price=0\n4. `query_positions.py` change was reverted (it was correct, daily PnL -1.82 is accurate)\n5. The `kj` restart is still pending to apply the code fixes\n\nLet me keep it brief.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"对，修了 2 个 bug：\n\n1. `binance_auto_trade.py` — `reduceOnly` 之前没传给币安，小仓位平不掉\n2. `crypto_signal_monitor.py` — 加了价格防御，price=0 不会再下垃圾单\n\n就等你回家 `kj` 重启生效，其他都正常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":7374,"output":391,"cacheRead":99840,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":107605,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780370134345}}
