{"type":"compaction","id":"6598cc59","parentId":"5120360c","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:50:38.217Z","summary":"## Goal\n排查 ETC/XRP 开仓金额异常问题 —— 用户（老公）发现 ETH 和 XRP 的开仓金额不对，名义价值只有 ~$12-16 而非预期的 ~$200。\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- 模拟盘 Testnet 环境\n- 单仓 20% 仓位，10x 杠杆，总本金 100 USDT\n- 预期每仓名义价值 = 100 × 0.20 × 10 = 200 USDT\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] 查询了当前持仓：DOT/ETH/XRP/BTC 共 4 个\n- [x] 获取实时价格：XRP $1.2948，ETC 不在监控列表\n- [x] 详细持仓数据确认异常：\n  - **ETH LONG**: qty=0.008, entry=$1998.41, notional≈$15.99 (应为 ~$200) ❌\n  - **XRP LONG**: qty=9.5, entry=$1.2838, notional≈$12.20 (应为 ~$200) ❌\n  - DOT SHORT: qty=-171.1, entry=$1.144, notional≈$195.74 ✅\n  - BTC SHORT: qty=-0.003, entry=$73252, notional≈$219.76 ✅\n- [x] 定位到数量计算公式（`crypto_signal_monitor.py` line 1057）：\n  ```python\n  raw_qty = (CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * size_pct * 10) / entry_price\n  ```\n- [x] 确认 `auto_trade_config.json` 中 `risk_control.position_size_pct` = 10（不是 0.20）\n- [x] 确认 CONFIG 硬编码默认值：`total_capital=100, position_size_pct=0.20`\n- [x] ETC 确认不是加密货币 ETC（Ethereum Classic），用户说的是 ETH + 中文\"等等\"\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] 确认根因：ETH/XRP 实际数量（0.008 和 9.5）与公式计算结果（0.1 和 155.8）差了 ~16 倍\n  - 假说：如果 `total_capital` 实际为 ~8 USDT 而非 100，则数量吻合\n  - 假说：CONFIG 可能在某处被动态覆盖\n  - 需要追踪运行时 CONFIG 的实际值\n\n### Blocked\n- （无）\n\n## Key Decisions\n- 暂无\n\n## Next Steps\n1. 检查 `crypto_signal_monitor.py` 运行时 CONFIG 是否被 `auto_trade_config.json` 覆盖\n2. 追踪 CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] 运行时的实际值（可能被修改为 ~8）\n3. 如果 total_capital 确实被改了，修正配置或覆盖逻辑\n4. 对 ETH 和 XRP 的现有仓位进行补仓或平仓处理\n\n## Critical Context\n- **脚本目录**: `~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/`\n- **核心模块**: `binance_auto_trade.py`（下单/API），`crypto_signal_monitor.py`（策略/信号）\n- **配置文件**: `auto_trade_config.json`（`total_capital_usdt: 100, position_size_pct: 10`）\n- **监控进程**: `crypto_signal_monitor.py` (PID 24154) + `crypto_monitor_watchdog.py` (PID 24180)\n- **数量精度映射**: ETH=3位, XRP=1位, BTC=3位, DOT=1位（`get_quantity_precision`）\n- **异常数量**: ETH 0.008 (应 0.1), XRP 9.5 (应 155.8)，差距约 12-16 倍\n- **正常仓位**: DOT ~$196, BTC ~$220，均接近预期的 $200\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Decisions\n- **Fix 1 — `reduceOnly` bug in `binance_auto_trade.py`**: Added `\"reduceOnly\": str(reduce_only).lower()` to the order_params dict in `place_order()` function.\n- **Fix 2 — Price validation in `crypto_signal_monitor.py`**: Added a guard at the start of `open_position()` to reject orders when `entry_price` is ≤0 or >1,000,000.\n- **Root cause identified but not fully resolved**: On 2026-05-30 ~07:05, 4 malformed positions (ETH 0.098, XRP 139.6, DOT 11.7, BTC 0.003) appeared on Binance testnet from an unknown source (not created by the monitor). The monitor's position rebuild code synced these wrong amounts into local cache, and over time ETH degraded to 0.008 and XRP to 9.5.\n\n## Open TODOs\n- Monitor (`crypto_signal_monitor.py`) needs restart (requires user's explicit approval per agent rules) to pick up changes\n- Positions on exchange have been corrected: ETH=0.1, XRP=155.8, DOT=-171.1, BTC=-0.003\n\n## Constraints/Rules\n- Do NOT proactively suggest `kj restart` or any destructive operation — user must explicitly request it\n\n## Pending user asks\n- User's question \"改完看看哪里的代码出问题了\" was addressed — bugs found and explained\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- **Files modified**:\n  - `/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py` — added `reduceOnly` field to order_params\n  - `/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py` — added price guard before qty calculation\n- **Current positions on Binance Testnet**: ETH LONG 0.1 @ $2004, XRP LONG 155.8 @ $1.295, DOT SHORT -171.1 @ $1.144, BTC SHORT -0.003 @ $71289\n- **Log file**: `/root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log`\n- **Binance API error**: `code=-4164` (notional too small), `code=-2022` (ReduceOnly rejected)\n- **Group chat ID**: `oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49`\n- **Sender ID**: `ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166`\n\n## Recent turns preserved verbatim\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata)