{"type":"message","id":"1ddf1f82","parentId":"36fa395b","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:51:18.770Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ET_8OVwYyODex9jay7x8QCM0840","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-02.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":131,"output":61,"cacheRead":54144,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54336,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780372276273}}
{"type":"message","id":"d2a50295","parentId":"1ddf1f82","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:51:18.861Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_ET_8OVwYyODex9jay7x8QCM0840","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-06-02 日志\n\n## Bug 修复\n\n### 1. binance_auto_trade.py — `reduceOnly` 未传给币安 API\n- `place_order()` 函数接受 `reduce_only` 参数但从未放入 `order_params`\n- 导致小仓位（如 ETH 0.008）无法平仓：币安要求 notional ≥ $20，reduce_only 可豁免\n- **修复**: 在 order_params 中加入 `\"reduceOnly\": str(reduce_only).lower()`\n\n### 2. crypto_signal_monitor.py — `open_position()` 缺少价格校验\n- 当 entry_price=0 时，`100 * 0.20 * 10 / 0 = inf`，会导致异常下单\n- **修复**: 在数量计算前加入价格有效性检查（≤0 或 >1,000,000 则拒绝）\n\n### 修复状态\n- 2 个补丁已写入文件，待 `kj` 重启 monitor 生效\n- 老公说下课回家后重启\n\n## ETH/XRP 仓位修复过程\n\n### 问题\n- ETH: 实际 0.008 ETH (~$16 notional)，应为 0.1 ETH (~$200)\n- XRP: 实际 9.5 XRP (~$12 notional)，应为 155.8 XRP (~$200)\n- DOT 和 BTC 仓位正常\n\n### 根因\n- 5月30日币安侧凭空出现一批畸形仓位（非 monitor 创建）\n- Monitor 的\"反转重建\"代码读到畸形仓位后重建了本地缓存\n- 随着时间推移错误仓位越缩越小（ETH 0.098→0.008, XRP 139.6→9.5）\n- `reduceOnly` bug 导致小仓位无法平掉\n\n### 修复操作\n- 关闭 XRP 旧仓（成功）\n- ETH 平仓被拒（notional < $20 + reduceOnly bug）\n- 改为补仓策略：ETH 补 0.092 → 共 0.1 ETH\n- XRP 重开 155.8\n- 手动补设置止盈止损（因 manual place_order 未带 TP/SL）\n\n### 今日已实现盈亏核实\n- BTC TP1 止盈: +$7.25（10:14 触发）\n- 凌晨 03:29 ETH 旧仓止损: -$3.44\n- 上午 ETH/XRP 止损: -$5.73\n- 今日合计: -$1.82（Binance API 确认，query_positions.py 正确）\n\n## 当前状态\n- 3 个持仓: DOT SHORT, ETH LONG, XRP SHORT\n- 净盈亏约 -$3.88\n- 所有进程正常运行（monitor, watchdog, reminder, news）\n- 2 个补丁待 kj 重启\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780372278851}}
{"type":"message","id":"49004bd7","parentId":"d2a50295","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:51:24.315Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to append the new info after the restart.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_A7splbEkktYsMRb3yshh9413","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-02.md","old_string":"- 2 个补丁待 kj 重启","new_string":"- 2 个补丁待 kj 重启\n\n## kj 重启后 (11:46)\n\n### 进程状态（共 4 个 Python 进程，非用户说的\"13 个任务\"）\n- Monitor: PID 23869（新启动，补丁生效）\n- Watchdog: PID 23893\n- News: PID 23856\n- Reminder: PID 23885\n\n### 重启后日志\n- 重启后（11:46 起）零报错\n- 历史 8242 条 ERROR 全部是 Binance 测试网 SSL/超时（网络波动，非代码 bug）\n\n### 当前持仓\n- DOT SHORT, ETH LONG, XRP SHORT\n- 净盈亏 ~-$3.61"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":706,"output":291,"cacheRead":54272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55269,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780372278866}}
